cd backend
echo. > .gitignore
```

**Content for `backend/.gitignore`:**
```
# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
out/

# Database files - IMPORTANT!
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache

# Sensitive files
appsettings.Development.json
*.pfx
*.key

# Logs
*.log
logs/
```

### 3. Frontend .gitignore

The frontend should already have `.gitignore` from `create-react-app`, but verify it contains:

**Content for `frontend/.gitignore`:**
```
# Dependencies
node_modules/
/.pnp
.pnp.js

# Testing
/coverage

# Production
/build

# Environment files
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

